socket.io-client-cpp
------------------------------------------
C++11 implementation of Socket.IO client

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libsioclient1-3.1.0-1bl1
  libssl3-3.5.9-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.13-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libssl-devel-3.5.9-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/socketio/socket.io-client-cpp

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/socketio/socket.io-client-cpp/archive/3.1.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack socket.io-client-cpp-3.1.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./socket.io-client-cpp-3.1.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/socket.io-client-cpp-3.1.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/socket.io-client-cpp-3.1.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libsioclient1-3.1.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libsioclient-devel-3.1.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(socket.io-client-cpp)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/socket.io-client-cpp.README
  /usr/share/doc/socket.io-client-cpp/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/socket.io-client-cpp/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/socket.io-client-cpp/LICENSE_1_0.txt
  /usr/share/doc/socket.io-client-cpp/README.md
  /usr/share/doc/socket.io-client-cpp/license.txt

(libsioclient1)
  /usr/bin/cygsioclient-1.dll
  /usr/bin/cygsioclient_tls-1.dll

(libsioclient-devel)
  /usr/include/sio_client.h
  /usr/include/sio_message.h
  /usr/include/sio_socket.h
  /usr/lib/libsioclient.dll.a
  /usr/lib/libsioclient_tls.dll.a

